      ],
      "text": "proportional to the relative group size was applied, improving upon a constant correction. The method",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.95269775390625,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        79.31470489501953,
        527.3906860351562,
        95.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "(148) considers sparse data and imbalanced groups  . Between-study heterogeneity was assessed",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        92.51471710205078,
        527.4172973632812,
        108.23371887207031
      ],
      "text": "(149) (150) using Cochran’s Q test  , with a 0.10 significance threshold and the I-squared metric   (>50%",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        106.99073028564453,
        527.4003295898438,
        121.43373107910156
      ],
      "text": "indicating significant heterogeneity). For descriptive analysis, the pooled proportions of the seven",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        120.19074249267578,
        527.5921630859375,
        134.6337432861328
      ],
      "text": "outcomes of interest were calculated in the groups of patients receiving MDR-TB and HCV treatment",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.997900009155273,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        133.3907012939453,
        527.1991577148438,
        147.8336944580078
      ],
      "text": "co-administration and, separately, in the groups receiving MDR-TB treatment with delay of HCV",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        146.59071350097656,
        527.4539184570312,
        161.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "treatment. The single-arm proportions were pooled by fitting binomial generalized linear mixed",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        159.7907257080078,
        527.3848266601562,
        174.2337188720703
      ],
      "text": "models with a logit link. Although the analysis of comparative data was used for decision-making,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        172.99073791503906,
        524.41259765625,
        187.43373107910156
      ],
      "text": "the pooled proportions (which included additional data, albeit from a mix of comparative and non-",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        186.1907501220703,
        527.5536499023438,
        200.6337432861328
      ],
      "text": "comparative cohorts) were also considered, to support the GDG’s discussions (e.g. when considering",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.996549606323242,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        199.3907012939453,
        181.52610778808594,
        213.8336944580078
      ],
      "text": "the direction of effects).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        230.23463439941406,
        523.96435546875,
        245.89462280273438
      ],
      "text": "Summary of evidence on desirable and undesirable effects and certainty of evidence",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        253.1024932861328,
        527.548828125,
        267.5455017089844
      ],
      "text": "Sixteen respondents (expert clinicians) from nine countries provided patient outcome data in the expert",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.945363998413086,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        266.302490234375,
        527.52978515625,
        280.7455139160156
      ],
      "text": "evidence survey, with outcomes reported for a total of 135 patients who received co-administration of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.970660209655762,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        279.50250244140625,
        527.186279296875,
        293.9455261230469
      ],
      "text": "treatment for MDR-TB and HCV, and 439 patients who received treatment for MDR-TB only, with delay",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.962937355041504,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        292.7025146484375,
        527.4376220703125,
        307.1455383300781
      ],
      "text": "of HCV treatment. Among these responses, eight respondents contributed data from both cohorts",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        305.90252685546875,
        527.4562377929688,
        320.3455505371094
      ],
      "text": "(i.e. intervention and comparator) for the comparative analysis, and the other eight contributed data",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.999750137329102,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        319.1024169921875,
        527.4432983398438,
        333.5454406738281
      ],
      "text": "only for the intervention or comparator cohorts for the descriptive analysis. The overall certainty of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        332.3023986816406,
        527.4168090820312,
        346.74542236328125
      ],
      "text": "the evidence was very low, with the calculated estimates of effects based on outcome data from",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        345.5024108886719,
        527.4146118164062,
        359.9454345703125
      ],
      "text": "recall or records obtained from the expert evidence survey; hence, there was a very serious risk of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        358.702392578125,
        527.4067993164062,
        373.1454162597656
      ],
      "text": "bias due to potential confounding, selection bias, and recall (i.e. outcome assessment) bias, as well",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        371.90240478515625,
        331.1832580566406,
        386.3454284667969
      ],
      "text": "as imprecision in the effect estimates for most outcomes.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        402.7463073730469,
        161.05809020996094,
        418.40631103515625
      ],
      "text": "Desirable effects",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        425.61431884765625,
        527.572021484375,
        440.0573425292969
      ],
      "text": "Co-administration of MDR-TB and HCV treatments as compared to MDR-TB treatment only with",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        438.814208984375,
        527.4520263671875,
        453.2572326660156
      ],
      "text": "delay of HCV treatment may result in an increase in MDR-TB treatment success, but the evidence",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        452.0141906738281,
        527.4221801757812,
        466.45721435546875
      ],
      "text": "is very uncertain (RR: 1.25; 95% CI: 1.07 to 1.46; very low certainty in the evidence of effects); this",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        465.2142028808594,
        527.6270751953125,
        479.6572265625
      ],
      "text": "corresponds to 163 more MDR-TB treatment successes per 1000 patients (95% CI: 46 more to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        478.4142150878906,
        527.4100952148438,
        492.85723876953125
      ],
      "text": "300 more). Use of MDR-TB and HCV treatment co-administration may also result in fewer cases of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        491.61431884765625,
        527.4057006835938,
        506.0573425292969
      ],
      "text": "MDR-TB treatment failure, but again the evidence is very uncertain (RR: 0.30; 95% CI: 0.12 to 0.74;",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        504.814208984375,
        527.4146118164062,
        519.2572021484375
      ],
      "text": "very low certainty in the evidence of effects); this corresponds to 27 fewer failed MDR-TB treatments",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        518.01416015625,
        527.3946533203125,
        532.4571533203125
      ],
      "text": "per 1000 patients (95% CI: 34 fewer to 10 fewer). Co-administration of treatments may also result",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        531.2142333984375,
        527.41796875,
        545.6572265625
      ],
      "text": "in fewer losses to follow-up, but the evidence is very uncertain (RR: 0.42; 95% CI: 0.24 to 0.73; very",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        544.4141845703125,
        527.4111328125,
        558.857177734375
      ],
      "text": "low certainty in the evidence of effects); this corresponds to 103 fewer losses to follow-up per 1000",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        557.6143188476562,
        259.6370849609375,
        572.0573120117188
      ],
      "text": "patients (95% CI: 135 fewer to 48 fewer).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        579.3182373046875,
        527.3914184570312,
        593.76123046875
      ],
      "text": "Use of MDR-TB and HCV treatment co-administration may also result in a small decrease in deaths,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        592.5181884765625,
        527.5352783203125,
        606.961181640625
      ],
      "text": "although the evidence is again very uncertain (RR: 0.98; 95% CI: 0.22 to 4.33; very low certainty in the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.983988761901855,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        605.7182006835938,
        527.1251220703125,
        620.1611938476562
      ],
      "text": "evidence of effects); this corresponds to two fewer deaths per 1000 patients (95% CI: 92 fewer to 391",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.995348930358887,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        618.918212890625,
        527.395751953125,
        633.3612060546875
      ],
      "text": "more). For HCV treatment success, very few events were reported based on only seven patients in",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        632.1182250976562,
        527.4124145507812,
        646.5612182617188
      ],
      "text": "one of the comparative cohorts, and no conclusions could be drawn regarding this health outcome.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        645.3182373046875,
        527.438720703125,
        659.76123046875
      ],
      "text": "The GDG noted the knowledge gap about HCV treatment outcomes due to insufficient data. In nine",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        658.5181884765625,
        527.4441528320312,
        672.961181640625
      ],
      "text": "cohorts with a total of 124 patients receiving co-administration of MDR-TB and HCV treatments, the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        671.7182006835938,
        527.4376220703125,
        686.1611938476562
      ],
      "text": "pooled estimate for HCV treatment success was 95.1% (95% CI: 84.3% to 98.6%). With respect to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        684.918212890625,
        527.4090576171875,
        699.3612060546875
      ],
      "text": "additional considerations, the GDG also noted the potential benefit of additional adherence support",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        698.1182250976562,
        527.368408203125,
        712.5612182617188
      ],
      "text": "for HCV treatment while also receiving MDR-TB treatment. The GRADE evidence profile provides",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        711.3182373046875,
        527.635498046875,
        725.76123046875
      ],
      "text": "a complete description of the estimates of effects, as well as the descriptive analysis of pooled",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
